<br/>So, I suggest either ignoring my comments, or getting some thicker skin?  You two have been around the block long enough to handle some criticism or should be at least.</td>', 'Originally posted by MargaretNet: Originally posted by glad2badad: ... If its not all praise and sunshine some people just cant handle it. 
